hadiths[73]{hadithnumber,text}:
"578","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini that his father said that he had heard Abu Said al-Khudri say that the Messenger of Allah"
"579","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd arRahman ibn Abi Sasaca al-Ansari from al-Mazini from his father from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"580","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz wrote to his governor in Damascus about zakat saying"
"581","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Uqba"
"582","Yahya related to me from Malik from Urwa ibn Husayn from A'isha bint Qudama that her father said"
"583","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"584","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"585","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from more than one source that the Messenger of Allah"
"586","Malik said"
"587","Malik said"
"588","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to adorn his daughters and slave-girls with gold jewellery and he did not take any zakat from their jewellery. Malik said"
"589","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"590","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim that his father said"
"591","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that A'isha"
"592","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said bought some property on behalf of his brother's sons who were orphans in his house"
"593","Yahya related to me that Malik said"
"594","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Abi Tamima as- Sakhtayani that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz"
"595","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Khusayfa that he had asked Sulayman ibn Yasar whether zakat was due from a man who had wealth in hand but also owed a debt for the same amount"
"596","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Zurayq ibn Hayyan"
"597","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"598","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abu's-Salih as-Samman that Abu Hurayra used to say"
"599","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had read what Umar ibn al- Khattab had written about zakat"
"600","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki from Tawus al Yamani that from thirty cows"
"601","Yahya said that Malik said"
"602","Yahya said that Malik said"
"603","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban said"
"604","Yahya related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"605","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abu Bakr as-Siddiq said"
"606","Yahya related to me from Malik that Zayd ibn Aslam said"
"607","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that one of the administrators of Umar ibn Abd al-'Aziz wrote to him mentioning that a man had refused to pay zakat on his property. Umar wrote to the administrator and told him to leave the man alone and not to take any zakat from him when he took it from the other muslims. The man heard about this and the situation became unbearable for him"
"608","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Sulayman ibn Yasar and from Busr ibn Said that the Messenger of Allah"
"609","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ziyad ibn Sad that Ibn Shihab said"
"610","Yahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about olives and he said"
"611","Malik said"
"612","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Sulayman ibn Yasar that the people of Syria said to Abu Ubayda ibn al-Jarrah"
"613","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Amr ibn Hazim said"
"614","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"615","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"616","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad ibn Ali from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab mentioned the magians and said"
"617","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Aslam"
"618","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from his father that he said to Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"619","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz wrote to his governors telling them to relieve any people who payed the jizya from paying the jizya if they became muslims. Malik said"
"620","Yahya related to me from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to take a twentieth from the cereals and olive oil of the Nabatean christians"
"621","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid said"
"622","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab why Umar ibn al Khattab used to take a tenth from the Nabateans"
"623","Yahya related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said that he had heard Umar ibn al-Khattab say"
"624","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab gave a horse to carry some one in the way of Allah"
"625","Yahya said that Malik was asked about whether a man who gave some sadaqa"
"626","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"627","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from lyad ibn Abdullah ibn Sad ibn Abi Sarh al-Amiri that he had heard Abu Said al- Khudri say"
"628","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would always pay the zakat al-fitr in dates"
"629","Maliksaid"
"630","Yahya related to me that Malik had seen that the people of knowledge used to like to pay the zakat al-fitr after dawn had broken on the day of the Fitr before they went to the place of prayer. Malik said"
"631","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"632","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"633","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that once in the time of Uthman ibn Affan the new moon had been seen in the afternoon and Uthman did not break his fast until evening had come and the sun had set. Yahya said that he had heard Malik say that some one who sees the new moon of Ramadan when he is on his own should start the fast and not break it if he knows that that day is part of Ramadan. He added"
"634","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"635","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that A'isha and Hafsa"
"636","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Sad as Saidi that the Messenger of Allah"
"637","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Harmala al- Aslami from Said ibn al-Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"638","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Humayd ibn Abd ar-Rahman that Umar ibn al-Khattab and Uthman ibn Affan would pray maghrib when they saw the night darkening"
"639","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Mamar al-Ansari from Abu Yunus"
"640","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd Rabbih ibn Said from Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham from A'isha and Umm Salama"
"641","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"642","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"643","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a certain man kissed his wife while he was fasting in Ramadan. This made him very anxious"
"644","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"645","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Atika bint Zayd ibn Amr ibn Nufayl"
"646","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n-Nadr"
"647","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Abu Hurayra and Sad ibn Abi Waqqas used to say that someone who was fasting was allowed to kiss"
"648","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that A'isha"
"649","Yahya said that Malik said that Hisham ibn Urwa ibn az-Zubayr had said"
"650","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked about people kissing while fasting and he said that he allowed it for old men but disapproved of it for young men"